<title>USA: Buffton to sell power quality products unit.</title>
<headline>Buffton to sell power quality products unit.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WORTH, Texas 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Buffton Corp said it has agreed to sell all of the assets of Current Technology Inc, its power quality products business, to Danaher Corp for $25.5 million in cash and the assumption of certain liabilities.</p>
<p>Buffton said the sale has been approved by its board of directions and is to be submitted to stockholders for approval at the company's 1997 annual meeting this spring.</p>
<p>The company said that in connection with the sale it will also submit to stockholders a proposal to change the name of the company to BHX Hospitality Group Inc.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
